=== Kasus Uji 5: Pengembangan Tugas D — Detail Indeks & Filter Query ===
$ curl -i http://localhost:5000/messages/0
HTTP/1.0 200 OK
Server: BaseHTTP/0.6 Python/3.11.18
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:20:33 GMT
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Content-Length: 137
Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, POST, DELETE, OPTIONS
Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Content-Type

{"index": 0, "message": {"message": "Data praktikum CI/CD NIM 101012300238 - pesan 1", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:20:33.903698+00:00"}}

$ curl -i "http://localhost:5000/messages?q=persistensi"
